{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605260/extras/c088ac4130e701d1f5109a29b5bd45e6.avif?t=1761699201\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605260/extras_big/c088ac4130e701d1f5109a29b5bd45e6.avif?t=1761699201 width=800 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a powerful lich, you've secured your immortality by binding your soul to a precious phylactery. But when a group of foolhardy adventurers steals it, you must embark on a relentless pursuit across five diverse worlds to reclaim what\u2019s rightfully yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem? The locals aren\u2019t exactly thrilled to see an undead sorcerer roaming their lands. Battle your way through hordes of enemies, unleashing fiery destruction with your signature fireball spell and wielding an arsenal of weapons you collect along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reclaim your phylactery, or will these so-called heroes put an end to your reign? The chase is on!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605260/extras/a4ece89ba2ba8506d2a1fceb42952ea7.poster.avif?t=1761699201\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605260/extras/a4ece89ba2ba8506d2a1fceb42952ea7.webm?t=1761699201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605260?t=1761699201","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605260?t=1761699201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605260/473ff94afde842c012ae92ba89edba